# Interaction Limitations for Dashboards

CRM Analytics supports interactions in numerous places, but not everywhere. Review these limitations before you create any interactions.

You can bind widget properties in chart and number widgets only. You can bind all except these properties.

| Widget Type | Unsupported Widget Properties                                                                                                                |
| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Number      | <ul><li>`borderEdges`</li><li>`borderWidth`</li><li>`compact`</li><li>`exploreLink`</li><li>`measureField`</li><li>`textAlignment`</li></ul> |
| Chart       | <ul><li>`borderEdges`</li><li>`borderRadius`</li><li>`borderWidth`</li><li>`exploreLink`</li><li>`measureField`</li></ul>                    |

You can’t bind these query properties:

- `selectMode`
